Package: AchillesNext
Type: Package
Title: Development Tracer for OMOP Characterization Results
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Chen", email = "alex@omophub.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Precomputes exact population, observation opportunity and eight-domain
    characterization and whole-source measurement reports from PostgreSQL OMOP
    sources into a restricted typed
    aggregate store. Includes saved concept and calendar selection, exact summaries,
    explicit schema support states, a separate bounded synthetic measurement tracer,
    versioned bundles, approved publication tools and a reusable React view.
    Generates complete restricted core candidates with saved metadata and executes
    checked full-recomputation refresh plans. General input reuse and
    production-scale qualification are not yet implemented.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: DatabaseConnector (>= 6.3.2), digest, jsonlite, rJava, httpuv (>= 1.6.0)
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 8), PostgreSQL JDBC driver
URL: https://github.com/alex-omophub/achilles-next
BugReports: https://github.com/alex-omophub/achilles-next/issues
